{
  "title": "example",
  "created_at": "2026-04-17T13:43:37.760863",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "text": "An example is a specific case or model",
      "media": {
        "type": "image",
        "file_path": "media/0_70153881bf08ed58.jpg",
        "url": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "that shows what something is like or how it works.",
      "media": {
        "type": "image",
        "file_path": "media/1_f299d1ba31348449.jpeg",
        "url": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "It is a clear illustration",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/2_0e2caa1e564165f8.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "used to explain a rule, an idea, or a general statement.",
      "media": {
        "type": "image",
        "file_path": "media/3_6d5186535d1d171e.jpeg",
        "url": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "We use examples every day",
      "media": {
        "type": "image",
        "file_path": "media/4_9a01e68a64d173e8.jpeg",
        "url": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "to make things easier to understand.",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/5_d280dda4dd633684.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "For instance, a teacher might use a simple math problem",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "as an example before giving a harder test.",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "A friend might show you a photo",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "as an example of a place they want to visit.",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "In all these cases, the example acts as a helpful guide.",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "It makes abstract thoughts concrete",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "and connects new information to what we already know.",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "An interesting fact about examples",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "is that our brains are wired to learn from them",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "more effectively than from abstract rules alone.",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "Studies show that people remember information better",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "and can apply it more easily",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "when it is presented with a clear, relatable example.",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "This is why stories and real-world cases",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "are such powerful teaching tools.",
      "media": null
    }
  ],
  "voiceover_path": "audio/voiceover.mp3"
}